  "description": "⭐ <em>Brought to you by the creators of Alcotraz and Moonshine Saloon, </em><strong><em>Avora: A New World Immersive Experience</em></strong><em> in London promises to be another exciting theatrical adventure. Immersive film-like sets, talented actors, and exotic drinks await, making for a truly magical experience.</em><br>\n👉 <em>For private hires or special occasion bookings of 12+ people, even for unlisted dates, check out the ‘Booking &amp; Ticketing’ section of the </em><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.avora-experience.co.uk/faqs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>FAQs</em></a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Tickets for Avora:</strong><br>\n🎫&nbsp;<strong>Intern Ticket</strong>&nbsp;- includes entry for 1 to Avora.<br>\n🎫&nbsp;<strong>Researcher Ticket</strong>&nbsp;- includes entry for 1 to Avora + a take home a piece of Avora (an exquisite flowering green tea bud layered with hints of peach, jasmine and lily to enjoy at home).<br>\n🎫&nbsp;<strong>Doctorate Ticket</strong>&nbsp;- includes entry for 1 to Avora + a take home a piece of Avora (a blooming bud to enjoy at home) + a bonus additional secret cocktail (so 4 in total.)<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🍹 Enjoy 3 expertly crafted signature concoctions<br>\n✨ Explore an extraordinary new paradise brought to life with theatrical sets<br>\n🗣️ Interact with talented actors and meet the local Avorians<br>\n👖 Take lots of incredible photos in your own Avora custom jumpsuit<br>\n🌳 A tree is planted for every ticket sold一feel good about making a difference<br>\n🎁 Click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/500444\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a> to get gift card tickets to Avora for your loved ones<br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select directly in the ticket selector<br>\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour and 45 minutes<br>\n📍 Location: 5C, 127 Hackney Rd, London E2 8GY<br>\n👤 Age requirement: 18+ with valid ID<br>\n♿ Accessibility: please check the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.avora-experience.co.uk/faqs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FAQs</a> for more information&nbsp;<br>\n👗 Dress code: you’ll be given a special Avora jumpsuit on arrival&nbsp;<br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.avora-experience.co.uk/faqs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n✔️ Safety measures will be in place throughout the experience<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nFrom the creators of <em>Alcotraz</em> and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/64913\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Moonshine Saloon</em></a> comes another incredible interactive theatrical experience. Get ready to enter the mystical land of Avora, brought to life with a mesmerising theatrical set and a talented cast of actors. Dressed in your special Avora jumpsuit, you’ll become part of the story as you mingle with local Avorians and sip on 3 expertly crafted signature concoctions. Watch this magical land light up before your eyes and delight in its beauty. Are you ready to join the resistance and save Avora from human destruction? Get your tickets for Avora: A New World Immersive Experience in London!",
